/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (Rev. Penny Lane Whittemore CNC BCNWP CHGp RHCH CHHWC is a dedicated and multifaceted professional, recognized as an ICAHP Accredited Holistic Training Provider with a broad array of certifications and achievements. Holding credentials such as a Registered Christian Clinical Herbalist by the Christian Herbalist Guild and a Registered Holistic Christian Herbalist by NHMEC, she brings a wealth of knowledge to her practice. She is also a Board Certified Nutritional Consultant and Natural Wellness Practitioner, with a Doctor of Natural Medicine diploma. Her expertise spans iridology, holistic nutrition, herbalism, and wellness coaching, supported by various diplomas and certificates from esteemed institutions. Additionally, she is a Certified Holistic Health and Wellness Coach \(CHHWC\) through The Holistic Coach Academy.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (In addition to her extensive qualifications, Rev. Whittemore is an ordained minister and a certified faith healer, committed to integrating spiritual and holistic approaches to health. She actively contributes to the community as Vice Chair of the Herbalists Without Borders Board and as a Chapter Volunteer Coordinator. Her creative pursuits include digital artistry and culinary skills as an Herbal Chef.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
