/E (NHMEC's online school offers a diverse selection of herbal courses tailored to various levels of expertise, from community memberships and monthly herb classes to foundational beginner sessions and advanced professional training. The curriculum is enriched with specialized lessons on Backyard Herbs and Christian herbalism practices, ensuring a comprehensive educational experience. Students have the opportunity to engage through multiple formats, including online classes, practical videos, in-person instruction, live Zoom sessions, and access to a dedicated student HUB, fostering a versatile learning environment.)
/Pg 32 0 R
