569 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (At the core of NHMEC's mission is the aspiration to provide education, training, products, and consultations through a Christian perspective, with Jesus Christ as the guiding light. This commitment is reflected in the holistic nature of the programs offered, which not only aim to impart knowledge but also to cultivate a ministry of healing. As emphasized by founder and instructor Penny Lane Whittemore, CNC, BCNWP, CHGp, RHCH, NHMEC is not just about acquiring a quick certificate; it is about embarking on a lifelong journey in natural health. The center's programs are meticulously designed to equip students with the profound knowledge and skills necessary to make a lasting impact in their communities, transforming both their lives and those they aim to help. It is important to note that while NHMEC offers a wealth of knowledge and resources, it does not function as a licensed medical provider.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [4]
>>
